            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for to kidnap, then the Kannada for a hostage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಅಷ್ಟರಲ್ಲಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಷ್ಟರಲ್ಲಿ — aṣṭaralli — \"meanwhile; by then\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಾನು ಬಾಗಿಲು ತೆರೆದೆ. ಅಷ್ಟರಲ್ಲಿ ಕಳ್ಳ ಓಡಿಹೋಗಿದ್ದನು. nānu bāgilu terede. aṣṭaralli kaḷḷa ōḍihōgiddanu. I opened the door. By then the thief had run away."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಷ್ಟು, that much, with -ಅಲ್ಲಿ, in: \"within that much time\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಷ್ಟರಲ್ಲಿ (aṣṭaralli) is native Dravidian: aṣṭu, \"that much\", is built on the pointing base a-, \"that, yonder\" (DEDR 1), with the ending -alli, \"in\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
