              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nānu bāgilu terede. aṣṭaralli kaḷḷa ōḍihōgiddanu.* — I opened the door. By then the thief had run away.]"
