          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಠಾತ್ತಾಗಿ — haṭhāttāgi — \"all of a sudden\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಠಾತ್ತಾಗಿ ದೀಪ ಆರಿಹೋಯಿತು. haṭhāttāgi dīpa ārihōyitu. All of a sudden the light went out."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A more bookish partner of ಇದ್ದಕ್ಕಿದ್ದಂತೆ. ಹಠಾತ್ ಸಾವು is a sudden death."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಠಾತ್ತಾಗಿ (haṭhāttāgi) is built on Sanskrit haṭhāt, \"by force\", the ablative of haṭha, \"violence, force\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada adverb ending -āgi."
            }
          ]
        },
