              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಏಕಾಏಕಿ ಬಸ್ ನಿಂತಿತು. ēkāēki bas nintitu. All at once the bus stopped."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of something sudden and without warning: ಏಕಾಏಕಿ (ēkāēki) ನಿರ್ಧಾರ, an abrupt decision."
            }
          ]
        },
